{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chesscape Room is a chess variant where you have to escape through a door with your king while the your opponent hunts you down. Solve countless puzzles in campaigns, compete locally and online, and create your own campaign for others to play! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/93c279ee8d73475fe14492240566b452.avif?t=1769117139\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/a446fd6b9d137490fdd48883d023e290.poster.avif?t=1769117139\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/a446fd6b9d137490fdd48883d023e290.webm?t=1769117139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/a446fd6b9d137490fdd48883d023e290.mp4?t=1769117139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play through countless handcrafted and procedurally generated boards in the official campaigns and try your hand at campaigns created by players like yourself!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/3bd5da81f7e29123603ef9b504f74f57.avif?t=1769117139\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/717848ef9db7b71e5fa93c57e2057634.poster.avif?t=1769117139\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/717848ef9db7b71e5fa93c57e2057634.webm?t=1769117139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/717848ef9db7b71e5fa93c57e2057634.mp4?t=1769117139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Challenge family and friends at come with local hotseat multiplayer, or compete online against other players. Includes ranked play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/fa4b6c4212634be0469c756cd7671344.avif?t=1769117139\" width=800 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/bd464ca9f6e8e8e6a5adb1d66d29ab12.poster.avif?t=1769117139\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/bd464ca9f6e8e8e6a5adb1d66d29ab12.webm?t=1769117139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949530/extras/bd464ca9f6e8e8e6a5adb1d66d29ab12.mp4?t=1769117139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In a nutshell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no opening theory to memorize, just clean, readable tactics with that \u201cone more try\u201d loop. Each stage is a chess puzzle that will sharpen your thinking. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaigns:</strong>\u00a0Official and player-made campaigns to play through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus</strong>: Local and online ranked multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom:</strong>\u00a0Generate custom boards for you to play endlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Editor:</strong>\u00a0A built-in editor that allows you to hand-craft boards and create your 